    "_evidence": "2026-11-02 probe of google/gemma-4-12B-it at 43c9d014 on training/config/images/Dockerfile.gemma4 (transformers 5.17.0, Unsloth 2026.10.11). With thinking off the generation prompt ends in an empty thought channel a finished turn lacks, so the trainer renders as served: 40 of 40 sampled records are prompt + content + <turn|>, and the served prompt's tokens are a prefix of the training tokens. The template emits the one <bos> and the tokenizer adds none, so nothing is stripped (Unsloth's Gemma 4 text recipe strips it; here that leaves none). The seven names match 328 Linear modules, all in language_model: the vision and audio parts have none of them. A merge keeps the base's weight names and changes only the seven targets, but transformers 5.17 rewrites config.json in a form vLLM's 5.13 cannot read (TypeError on num_global_key_value_heads), so the trainer restores the base's non-weight files."
